1. **Valid Git-quoted filenames can abort result recording.** [run_agent_eval.py:155](/home/ubuntu/work/gemma-wt/codex-eval-runner/eval/run_agent_eval.py:155) decodes Git C-style quoting using JSON. Git’s octal escapes—for example `caf\303\251.py`—produce `JSONDecodeError`; reproduced. Classification occurs outside the evaluation exception handler at [line 370](/home/ubuntu/work/gemma-wt/codex-eval-runner/eval/run_agent_eval.py:370), so a completed evaluation gets no journal row and can terminate the run. Use a Git-compatible decoder and preserve outcomes when diagnostics fail.

